s reset/write behavior, and final read priority:\nx0 is zero; otherwise an enabled matching write bypasses w_data;\notherwise return the selected stored word. Verify Gowin maps storage to\nfabric flops and keeps operand capture in fabric at ID/EX, removing the\nslow BSRAM launch that otherwise limits the registered-forwarding change.\n\n''' + h['hypothesis']\nh['hypothesis'] += '''\\\\n\\\\nTemporary isolated prototypes retained 4,202,272 CoreMark cycles and\npassed their existing pipeline and cosimulation checks. Neither isolated\nchange exceeded the required margin; those measurements do not establish\nthe final combined design's fitness. The combined mapping still requires\nunchanged formal, real arithmetic/pipeline tests, canonical cosimulation\nand all-placement median timing before acceptance. Extra flop/read-mux\narea and routing are additional risks; preserve reset semantics exactly.\n'''\nh['changes'].insert(0,{'file':'rtl/reg_file.sv','description':'Use 31 independent synchronously reset/written scalar words and balanced one-hot masked-OR read trees, retaining x0 and exact write-first priority. Verify fabric storage and ID/EX operand capture instead of BSRAM output launch.'})\nh['changes'].append({'file':'test/test_reg_file.py','description':'Retain all tests and add a deterministic scoreboard for all read-address pairs, distinct stored values, repeated writes, both-port bypass, x0, disabled writes and reset/write collisions.'})\np.write_text(yaml.safe_dump(h,sort_keys=False))\njsonschema.validate(h,json.loads(Path('schemas/hypothesis.schema.json').read_text()))\nprint('Final refinement written; schema valid')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
