alue. Make wb_stage\n  consume the selected retirement bundle's wb_value directly, leaving\n  its write enable and destination rules intact. Set direct divide\n  completion's wb_value to div_result alongside its existing alu_result.\n  The direct divide result must still reach RF/ID only, never\n…[3923 of 6995 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:1d4b0e52c8a32340]…\n/core.sv\n    description: |\n      Drive ordinary EX forwarding directly from the registered wb_value;\n      preserve retirement arbitration and separation of direct divide\n      completion from the retained ordinary WB forwarding source.\n  - file: rtl/wb_stage.sv\n    description: |\n      Use the retirement bundle's preselected wb_value for write data,\n      preserving write enable, destination, validity and x0 semantics.\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: |\n      Flatten forwarding plus PC/immediate ALU operand selection into\n      mutually exclusive masked sources. Preserve raw forwarded operands\n      for other consumers and populate direct completion's wb_value.\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: |\n      Extend bundle layouts and assertions for preselected WB data and\n      operand-mask equivalence. Cover all forwarding sources and operand\n      overrides, retained data under stalls, load widths, direct division\n      and unchanged retirement timing without weakening existing checks.\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
