nse advance the fetch PC to that prediction, even if decode is held\nby load-use or an older dmem operation. Stop fetching when the FIFO is full.\nNever enqueue an instruction while imemReady is zero.\n\nUse an empty-FIFO combinational bypass so zero-wait instruction delivery\nretains its current latency. ID sees the oldest buffered entry whenever\nthe FIFO is nonempty; otherwise it sees the current bus response only if\nimemReady is high. A ready bus response consumed directly by ID is not\nalso enqueued. If ID cannot accept it, enqueue it once and advance the\nfetch PC. When buffered ID delivery and bus acceptance occur together,\npop the old head and append the new fetched payload in order.\n…[3559 of 6631 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:56ef365d0c727dd6]…\nmhz': 31.291, 'outcome': 'regression'}\nfpga/core_bench_si.sv\nfpga/constraints/Tang_Nano_20K.cst\nfpga/constraints/clock.sdc\nfpga/bench_stall_gen.sv\nfpga/core_bench.sv\nfpga/scripts/synth.tcl\nfpga/scripts/nextpnr_run.sh\ntools/eval/holdout.py\ntools/eval/gowin.py\ntools/eval/formal.py\ntools/eval/test_gate_sanity.py\ntools/eval/_subprocess.py\ntools/eval/test_holdout.py\ntools/eval/fpga.py\ntools/eval/test_formal_workdir_cleanup.py\ntools/eval/test_rvfi_lint.py\ntools/eval/test_process_reaper.py\ntools/eval/test_formal_reclassify.py\ntools/eval/rvfi_lint.py\ntools/eval/test_remove_path.py\ntools/eval/test_subprocess_pgroup.py\ntools/eval/__init__.py\ntools/eval/test_slots.py\ntools/eval/test_bench_stall_gen.py\ntools/eval/test_fpga_report.py\ntools/eval/test_formal_nret.py\ntools/eval/cosim.py\ntools/eval/_slots.py\ncores/bench/test/_helpers.py\ncores/bench/test/test_decoder.py\ncores/bench/test/test_reg_file.py\ncores/bench/test/test_alu.py\ncores/bench/test/test_imm_gen.py\ncores/bench/test/test_pipeline.py\ncores/bench/test/conftest.py\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
