tion XOR (except offset +4) instead of a selected 32-bit next-PC comparison, shortening the redirect path without changing CoreMark cycles while JALR keeps a separate full-width comparison.\n- 2026-10-02 hyp-20261002-001-r5s0 (regression, +17.50%): Registering 34-bit 3D at launch lets three radix-4 steps with par\n…[146990 of 150062 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:2f994f7b2e4bfa20]…\nm word.\\nCheck ordered RVFI PCs and contiguous orders, exact operands, links,\\ntraps, no repeated training, no wrong-path side effects, no OOB\\nspeculation and unchanged ready-bus liveness. Preserve architectural\\nassertions and run formal, real/ALTOPS tests and full-RVFI cosim.\\n\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 120.69, \"delta_pct\": 4.95, \"vs_baseline\": 895.79, \"fmax_mhz\": 48.058, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3981775, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 3775, \"ff\": 1012, \"seeds\": [47.228, 48.058, 48.058], \"perturbations\": [[0, 47.228, 14], [1, 48.058, 31], [2, 48.058, 31]], \"lutram\": 8, \"bsram\": 6, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_rf/regs_regs_0_0_s0\", \"to\": \"dmem_0_dmem_0_0_0_s\", \"slack_ns\": -16.174, \"arrival_ns\": 26.469, \"logic_cells\": 14, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_ex\", \"cpu/u_ex/u_alu\", \"cpu/u_ex\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 14, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-10-02T20:19:32.771923Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 6}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
