{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"The champion’s reported worst path now runs from the instruction input through IF into a decode recovery register. Earlier fetch queues kept an empty-queue bypass, leaving that combinational path intact. I’m proposing a two-entry fetch buffer that always registers instructions before decode, targeting both that timing path and instruction-stall losses."}}
