{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_53","type":"agent_message","text":"The one-bit table also lost timing. I’m narrowing the proposal to a banked BHT update path: register training events, then forward any pending update to a matching prediction lookup so predictions stay unchanged. The software model verifies that forwarding rule; the proposed banking layout still needs measurement."}}
